        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_02">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="300" y="40" />
          <textBox font="cbf_ko-Hang-KR" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="16.6666679" y="20" />
            <text>통신 메뉴의 ｢어느새 통신｣에서 설정을 켜 주십시오.</text>
            <topColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_02" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_04">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="23" y="1" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="249" y="24" />
          <textBox font="cbf_ko-Hang-KR" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="20" y="24" />
            <text>데이터를 수신하기</text>
            <topColor r="255" g="255" b="255" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="255" g="255" b="255" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Center" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_04" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_05">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="300" y="160" />
          <textBox font="cbf_ko-Hang-KR" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="16.6666679" y="20" />
            <text>데이터는 자동으로 수신됩니다. 수신한 데이터는 통신 메뉴의 ｢수신 박스｣에서 확인하거나 월드 맵에 소환할 수 있습니다.
또한 ｢데이터 수신｣을 선택하면 최신 데이터를 받을 수 있습니다.</text>
            <topColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_05">
              <texMap imageName="18_01_u" imageNameLeft="" imageNameRight="" stereoEnabled="false" />
            </material>
            <texEnabled>true</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>RightTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>10</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>4</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>7</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>10</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_06">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="23" y="1" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="249" y="24" />
          <textBox font="cbf_ko-Hang-KR" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="20" y="24" />
            <text>｢어느새 통신｣을 그만두기</text>
            <topColor r="255" g="255" b="255" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="255" g="255" b="255" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Center" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_06" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_07">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="10" y="936" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="300" y="40" />
          <textBox font="cbf_ko-Hang-KR" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="16.6666679" y="20" />
            <text>어느새 통신을 끄려면 통신 메뉴의 ｢어느새 통신｣에서 설정을 꺼 주십시오.</text>
            <topColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_07" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_08">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="0" y="100" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="300" y="60" />
          <textBox font="cbf_ko-Hang-KR" autoWidthAdjust="true" indentEnabled="true" indentText="※">
            <fontSize x="16.6666679" y="20" />
            <text>&lt;indent/&gt;어느새 통신으로 다운로드한 데이터는 SD 카드에 저장됩니다. SD 카드는 항상 본체에 꽂아 두는 것을 권장합니다.</text>
            <topColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_08" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_09">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="10" y="769" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="300" y="120" />
          <textBox font="cbf_ko-Hang-KR" autoWidthAdjust="true" indentEnabled="true" indentText="※">
            <fontSize x="16.6666679" y="20" />
            <text>&lt;indent/&gt;월드 맵에 소환한 유닛은 ｢작별을 고한다｣ 등으로 월드 맵에서 삭제해도, 다시 수신 박스에서 월드 맵에 소환할 수 있습니다. 배포 아이템, 배포 맵, 배포 듀얼은 저장 데이터당 한 번만 반영할 수 있습니다.</text>
            <topColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_09" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_10">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="23" y="0" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="249" y="48" />
          <textBox font="cbf_ko-Hang-KR" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="20" y="24" />
            <text>어느새 통신으로
할 수 있는 것&lt;img src=spotpass_icon W/&gt;</text>
            <topColor r="255" g="255" b="255" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="255" g="255" b="255" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Center" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_10" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>RightBottom</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_11">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="300" y="60" />
          <textBox font="cbf_ko-Hang-KR" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="16.6666679" y="20" />
            <text>어느새 통신을 사용하려면 이용 약관에 대한 동의와 본체의 인터넷 설정이 필요합니다.</text>
            <topColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_11" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_12">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="15" y="13" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="270" y="80" />
          <textBox font="cbf_ko-Hang-KR" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="16.6666679" y="20" />
            <text>어느새 통신의 ON/OFF는 메인 메뉴의 ｢엑스트라｣에서 ｢어느새 통신｣을 선택하고 설정하는 방법으로도 가능합니다.</text>
            <topColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_12" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_13">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="0" y="60" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="300" y="120" />
          <textBox font="cbf_ko-Hang-KR" autoWidthAdjust="true" indentEnabled="true" indentText="※">
            <fontSize x="16.6666679" y="20" />
            <text>&lt;indent/&gt;이용 약관 및 인터넷 설정 방법에 대한 자세한 내용은 본체 사용설명서를 읽어 주십시오.
&lt;indent/&gt;어느새 통신을 사용하려면 SD 카드가 필요합니다. 본체를 실행하기 전에 먼저 꽂아 주십시오.</text>
            <topColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_13" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_29">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="10" y="2" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="250" y="22" />
          <textBox font="cbf_ko-Hang-KR" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="18.3333321" y="22" />
            <text>조작 순서</text>
            <topColor r="23" g="28" b="97" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="23" g="28" b="97" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Center" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_29" />
